      "writtenOn": "2025-06-30T14:53:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem in this case is that it only generates a PD_EVENT_CC if something is connected, so it will not generate a PD_EVENT_CC when the CC is open. That is why I add this config check to always generate a PD_EVENT_CC event when CC changes.",
      "parentUuid": "a8834ca8_b01d772c",
      "revId": "bb25e7baed52cf782e7be1c3c0ac1a5ab164361d",
